0 279 244 289T218 306L210 311Q204 311 181 294T133 239T107 157Q107 98 150 60T250 21Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"389\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"1168\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"1668\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-22C5\" x=\"2280\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"2780\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"3170\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-38\" x=\"3948\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"4449\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"4838\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Here, we have a product of two negative numbers, <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.971ex\" height=\"2.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1279 1008.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\\color{red}-2</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2212\" d=\"M84 237T84 250T98 270H679Q694 262 694 250T679 230H98Q84 237 84 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 